This private repository is an internal Everything AI Co competition closeout archive.
It contains original scripts and documentation, plus provenance notes about public
Kaggle notebooks and datasets that are not redistributed here.

Before any public release, review:

- Kaggle competition rules;
- source notebook and dataset licenses;
- third-party attribution requirements;
- whether an open-source license should apply to original code only.

No permission is granted to redistribute competition data, private outputs,
credentials, model weights, or copied third-party notebooks from this archive.
